                "_type": "Diesel Product Detail",
                "about": {
                    "image": {
                        "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-beyondblue-elinemedia-s2-1200x1600-129672704.jpg",
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    },
                    "developerAttribution": "E-Line Media",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "E-Line Media",
                    "description": "Beyond Blue is a single-player narrative adventure that takes you deep into our planet’s beating blue heart.\n\nSet in the near future, Beyond Blue explores the mysteries of our ocean through the eyes of Mirai, a deep-sea explorer and scientist. Become a part of a newly-formed research team using groundbreaking technologies to see, hear, and interact with the ocean in a more meaningful way than has ever been attempted.\n\n***Features***\n\n* Throughout eight different dives you'll explore the untouched world of our ocean and use technology at the edge of our understanding - tracking sea creatures, unraveling mysteries, and interacting with the ocean like never before\n* An evocative narrative with full voice cast - Anna Akana, Mira Furlan, Hakeem Kae-Kazim, and Ally Maki\n* A captivating and entertaining soundtrack featuring an original score and music from Miles Davis, The Flaming Lips, and more\n* Unlock 16 mini-documentaries called Ocean Insights that feature footage and interviews with science’s leading ocean experts\n\nEmbracing the same inclusive development process that was used to create Never Alone (Kisima Ingitchuna), E-Line’s BAFTA award-winning game about Alaska Native culture, the company partnered with BBC Studios (developers of the acclaimed Blue Planet II), OceanX Media, world-class game makers, and some of science’s leading ocean experts to craft an experience that reflects the awesome wonder and unbounded mystery that infuses our planet's beating blue heart.",
                    "shortDescription": "Beyond Blue is a single-player narrative adventure that takes you deep into our planet’s beating blue heart. Explore the awesome wonder and unbounded mystery that exists within the world’s ocean.",
